            "notes": "Play Zenyatta as a damage-forward support. \n\n [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) can be swapped out for [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) to reduce orb downtime/freeze caused by reloading.\n\nRound 1 effects:\n* Orb of Destruction (OD):\n- Damage increased from 50 to 52.\n- Replenishes 5 hp per hit.\n- Boosts Orb of Harmony (OH) healing by 18 hp per hit.\n- After elimination, attack speed increased from 0.4 seconds to 0.33 seconds for three seconds.\n* Snap Kick (SK):\n- Damage increased from 60 to 63.\n- Replenishes 6 hp with each hit.\n- Boosts OH healing by 22 hp per hit.",
