            "notes": "Take the [Dual Harmony](item_6484b4c4-294c-410d-ae1d-8049f161df31) power. While OH\u2019s base healing output is reduced by 12 hp/sec, we are compensating with 25% ability power (gaining 7 hp/sec back) and 25% weapon power (providing 21 \u2013 26 hp per hit with OD or snap kick). This means when you\u2019re dealing damage, OH is healing for at least 46 hp/sec for a net-gain of 16 hp/sec in addition to healing two teammates at once.\n\nFor items, pick up [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf). This item will increase OH\u2019s base healing with the increased AP as well as increase the healing output potential of Enlightenment through increased weapon damage.\n\nSell Frenzy Amplifier to afford the epic item. \n\nRound 3 effects:\n* Orb of Harmony (OH):\n- Healing decreased from 30 hp/sec to 25 hp/sec.\n* Orb of Destruction (OD):\n- Damage increased from 50 to 62.\n- Replenishes 6 hp per hit.\n- Boosts OH healing by 21 hp per hit.\n- After healing, attack speed increased from 0.4 seconds to 0.36 seconds for three seconds.\n* Snap Kick (SK):\n- Damage increased from 60 to 75.\n- Replenishes 7 hp with each hit.\n- Boosts OH healing by 26 hp per hit.\n\nIf you can\u2019t afford an epic item, consider two of these rare items: [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) (increase base OH healing and utilization of Enlightenment), [Breezeborne Blessing](item_90dbbc8e-b405-40a9-9564-8fa3a35a0202) (increase base OH healing), [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) (increase weapon power and survivability)",
