            "notes": "This round, we are increasing OD damage to further increase Enlightenment\u2019s effectiveness.\n\nIf you couldn\u2019t afford Orb of Perception in Round 3, sell the rare items you bought to pick it up this round. Then buy [Genji's Galvanic Gloves](item_f633cda1-b736-4071-9221-402af4ac7a43), or if you don\u2019t use your right-click attack often, you can buy [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) instead.\n\nRound 4 effects:\n* Orb of Harmony (OH):\n- Healing decreased from 30 hp/sec to 25 hp/sec.\n* Orb of Destruction (OD):\n- Damage increased from 50 to 67.\n- Replenishes 6 hp per hit.\n- Boosts OH healing by 23 hp per hit.\n- Attack speed increased from 0.4 seconds to 0.36.\n- After healing, attack speed increased from 0.36 seconds to 0.32 seconds for three seconds.\n* Snap Kick (SK):\n- Damage increased from 60 to 81.\n- Replenishes 8 hp with each hit.\n- Boosts OH healing by 28 hp per hit.\n\nIf you can\u2019t afford Genji\u2019s Galvanic Gloves, supplement with any of these rare items: [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) (increase base OH healing and utilization of Enlightenment), [Breezeborne Blessing](item_90dbbc8e-b405-40a9-9564-8fa3a35a0202) (increase base OH healing), [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) (increase weapon power and survivability).",
