            "notes": "Sell Plasma Converter to make room for an epic item. By now, you should have enough survivability to live without lifesteal.\n\nTake [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b). We\u2019re leaning into helping with eliminations and empowering Enlightenment even more.\nRound 6 effects:\n* Orb of Harmony (OH):\n- Healing decreased from 30 hp/sec to 25 hp/sec.\n* Orb of Destruction (OD):\n- Damage increased from 50 to 72.\n- Boosts OH healing by 25 hp per hit.\n- Attack speed increased from 0.4 seconds to 0.36.\n- After healing, attack speed increased from 0.36 seconds to 0.32 seconds for three seconds.\n* Snap Kick (SK):\n- Damage increased from 60 to 87.\n- Boosts OH healing by 30 hp per hit.\nIf you are struggling with survivability, you can instead take either [Meditation Mat](item_ce90ebff-042d-423c-a2f6-d38778629bba) to survive being dived on or [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) if you\u2019re dying to burst damage.",
