            "notes": "If you\u2019ve reached round 7, victory may come down to a single fight. To better guarantee winning the fight, take [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a). Paired with [Mind Shaper](item_c902b4f2-1151-4ec8-8dcd-f55144a45eb7), you can be more liberal in your use of Transcendence while giving your teammates a leg up to win the fight with reduced cooldowns.\n\nIf your team composition is focused on ranged attacks, transcendence won\u2019t have as much of an impact. In that case, you can take [Seeking Salvation](item_c424d9c0-3a6e-4eb6-b845-cfa284481307) along with [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) to help achieve eliminations while guaranteeing more healing through Enlightenment. If survivability is still a problem, take Gotta Have Faith or Inner Peace (whichever you don\u2019t already have.)\n\nSell Custom Stock to make room for the final epic item.\n\nRound 7 effects:\n* Orb of Harmony (OH):\n- Healing decreased from 30 hp/sec to 27 hp/sec.\n* Orb of Destruction (OD):\n- Damage increased from 50 to 70.\n- Boosts OH healing by 24 hp per hit.\n- Attack speed increased from 0.4 seconds to 0.36.\n- After healing, attack speed increased from 0.36 seconds to 0.32 seconds for three seconds.\n* Snap Kick (SK):\n- Damage increased from 60 to 84.\n- Boosts OH healing by 29 hp per hit.",
